        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer superior, cost- effective client service solutions, enabling insurer partners to receive feedbacks to the insurance products they underwrite and complete digitalized claim settlement in a timely manner.",
        "start_character": 29184,
        "end_character": 29408
      },
      {
