        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In terms of policy development, we have developed and adopted various internal control policies covering almost all aspects of our business, complaint handling, anti-money laundering, anti-bribery and intellectual property protection.",
